e et de qualité de service.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"46 Boulevard Pasteur","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjAwZDhiMTFjZWZkOTcxYzFkZWFiY2MwMGI2OWNhMzY4NGFmY2RlYjYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhZWZkYzhmZDQ3NjNmYTc5YjZmMTA2YjdkNzAyNmVjMSJ9?signature=7a34ea146a5c60e195924fab9fd423b11202c80477313af6a0012e6ae56e399c","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjllMjVhOTYxMjQ0ZDNkNmZmZmU1ZWFjMmZmMGE5OGU0MzY0ZWQ5NjIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIzZTRkMjBkZWFhMjUxODNkNGVlMzI5ZWU2M2FhMzYwMiJ9?signature=e171245ff99b827a4a15e6b933d950a8054fea4b37b72867114b4494b2b8ee43","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImE1NThmMDBkYjk0N2Q2ODJhNGIzODFkMzNhMTlkZGYxODYyMTc1Y2YiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJjMTNlMTFlNTA4MmJiYjhiYjdkNDhiM2ZhMWRlNWU3MiJ9?signature=d7c884cd62edd3c3f0dac362bf10815bb1fb26bc5de7b4377381150332ccdacc","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjdmYzVlMzBiMjc1NWE5NjdiYjQ2MzExZGI2M2UxNjJhNzAzZmY4NjkiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4YmUzZTc0NWZhMTNlNzIxZmYxY2Y4MWNkNWVlMjBjZSJ9?signature=c310edd0947f4a154e62de46cf953a0cf2a8de66084893fcf5327885379e5cea","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjM4ZDI5ODgzMGQzMGQ5M2UzZjFiMGE0Zjc1MWM4MDhlZTQ5MjQ0ZGQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI1YzUxMmJkYWI5MDFmOTZkODQ4MzBlOTM2NTJmZTM1MCJ9?signature=964a4717abe9